| A53 | GPT-4 (gpt-4, temp=0.2, principal). Embedding: OpenAI embedding model. | Closed (OpenAI) | 1.7T params (GPT-4) | Precision e Recall de state transitions (correto/parcialmente correto/incorreto/não encontrado). ProtocolGPT: Avg P=91.42%, R=87.09% (10 runs, p<0.05 max). GPT-QA baseline: P=35.83%, R=24.14%. Code coverage (statement coverage) via AFLNet: +31.80% vs GPT-QA, +22.66% vs Netzob, +21.99% vs NetPlier. 2 CVEs 0-day + 18 CVEs conhecidos (Feng RTSP). | Automática (ground truth por 3 experts, 72h+) + code coverage fuzzing |
